  - PROGRAMS CURRENTLY EXECUTING WITHIN THE SYSTEM.                     00550000
  - PROGRAMS WHICH HAVE ABNORMALLY TERMINATED (ABEND) AND ARE STILL IN  00600000
  MAIN STORAGE.                                                         00650000
  - PROGRAMS IN OBJECT OR LOAD MODULE FORMS WHICH MUST BE LOADED FROM   00700000
  SEQUENTIAL OR PARTITIONED DATASETS.                                   00750000
  THE TEST COMMAND ALLOWS YOU TO TEST PROGRAMS BY ENABLING YOU TO-      00800000
  - SUPPLY INITIAL VALUES (TEST DATA) TO THE PROGRAM UNDER TEST.        00850000
  - ESTABLISH BREAKPOINTS WITHIN A PROGRAM WHERE EXECUTION WILL BE      00900000
  INTERRUPTED FOR YOU TO EXAMINE INTERIM RESULTS.                       00950000
  - DISPLAY REGISTER AND MAIN STORAGE CONTENTS AT SUCH A BREAKPOINT.    01000000
  - MODIFY REGISTER AND MAIN STORAGE CONTENTS.                          01050000
  - DISPLAY THE PROGRAM STATUS WORD (PSW).                              01100000
  - LIST THE CONTENTS OF CONTROL BLOCKS, THESE ARE DEB, DCB AND TCB.    01150000
  - STEP THROUGH A SECTION OF THE PROGRAM EXECUTING ONE INSTRUCTION AT  01200000
  A TIME.                                                               01250000
