  AS WELL AS ADDRESSING RELATIVE TO THE FIRST BYTE OF THE PROGRAM.      01350000
  SYMBOLIC ADDRESSING CAN BE USED IN THE FOLLOWING INSTANCES-           01400000
  - IF THE PROGRAM WAS BOTH ASSEMBLED AND LINK EDITED USING THE 'TEST'  01450000
  OPTION, THE SYMBOLS IN THE ASSEMBLY CAN BE USED UNDER THE TEST        01500000
  COMMAND.  EXCEPTIONS INCLUDE SYMBOLS ON EQU, LTORG, AND ORG           01550000
  STATEMENTS.                                                           01600000
