  SYMBOLS IN THE EXTERNAL SYMBOL DICTIONARY CAN BE USED UNDER TEST      01700000
  - ANY SYMBOL DEFINED BY THE USE OF THE EQUATE SUBCOMMAND CAN BE USED. 01750000
